---
pagination:
  data: posts
  size: 1
  alias: p
permalink: "{{ p.brand }}/{{ p.slug }}/"
---
{%- set colors = p.slug | randomColorScheme -%}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html ⚡ lang="vi">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,minimum-scale=1,initial-scale=1,maximum-scale=1,user-scalable=no">
  <title>{{ p.title }}</title>
  <link rel="canonical" href="{{ p.canonical_url }}">
  <meta name="description" content="{{ p.description }}">
  <meta name="author" content="{{ p.author }}">
  
  <meta name="robots" content="index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1">
  <meta name="googlebot" content="index, follow">
  <meta name="bingbot" content="index, follow">
  <meta name="slurp" content="index, follow">
  
  <meta property="og:type" content="article">
  <meta property="og:title" content="{{ p.title }}">
  <meta property="og:description" content="{{ p.description }}">
  <meta property="og:url" content="{{ p.canonical_url }}">
  <meta property="og:site_name" content="{{ p.site_name }}">
  <meta property="og:image" content="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/1F8ap8DqzFsQj53kF5KXpWTs2gJSyZzcO=w248?authuser=0">
  <meta property="og:image:width" content="248">
  <meta property="og:image:height" content="100">
  <meta property="og:image:alt" content="{{ p.image_alt }}">
  
  <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
  <meta name="twitter:title" content="{{ p.title }}">
  <meta name="twitter:description" content="{{ p.description }}">
  <meta name="twitter:image" content="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/1F8ap8DqzFsQj53kF5KXpWTs2gJSyZzcO=w248?authuser=0">
  
  <link rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" href="/amp.ico">
  <link rel="shortcut icon" type="image/x-icon" href="/amp.ico">
  
  <script async src="https://cdn.ampproject.org/v0.js"></script>
  <script async custom-element="amp-auto-ads" src="https://cdn.ampproject.org/v0/amp-auto-ads-0.1.js"></script>
  <script async custom-element="amp-anim" src="https://cdn.ampproject.org/v0/amp-anim-0.1.js"></script>
  <style amp-boilerplate>body{-webkit-animation:-amp-start 8s steps(1,end) 0s 1 normal both;-moz-animation:-amp-start 8s steps(1,end) 0s 1 normal both;-ms-animation:-amp-start 8s steps(1,end) 0s 1 normal both;animation:-amp-start 8s steps(1,end) 0s 1 normal both}@-webkit-keyframes -amp-start{from{visibility:hidden}to{visibility:visible}}@-moz-keyframes -amp-start{from{visibility:hidden}to{visibility:visible}}@-ms-keyframes -amp-start{from{visibility:hidden}to{visibility:visible}}@-o-keyframes -amp-start{from{visibility:hidden}to{visibility:visible}}@keyframes -amp-start{from{visibility:hidden}to{visibility:visible}}</style><noscript><style amp-boilerplate>body{-webkit-animation:none;-moz-animation:none;-ms-animation:none;animation:none}</style></noscript>
  
  <style amp-custom>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }
    
    body {
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
      background: {{ colors.bg }};
      color: #ffffff;
      overflow-x: hidden;
      min-height: 100vh;
      -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
    }
      header {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      z-index: 1000;
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.95);
      padding: 10px 15px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid {{ colors.primary }}33;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      /* Hardware acceleration for fixed elements */
      transform: translate3d(0, 0, 0);
      -webkit-transform: translate3d(0, 0, 0);
    }
    
    header img {
      display: block;
    }
    
    .hero {
      padding: 80px 15px 40px;
      text-align: center;
      position: relative;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }
    
    .floating-image {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 480px;
      margin: 0 auto 30px;
    }
    
    .floating-image img {
      width: 100%;
      height: auto;
      display: block;
      transform: translate3d(0, 0, 0);
      -webkit-transform: translate3d(0, 0, 0);
    }
    
    h1 {
      font-size: 32px;
      font-weight: 900;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, {{ colors.primary }} 0%, {{ colors.secondary }} 50%, {{ colors.primary }} 100%);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      background-clip: text;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      text-shadow: 0 0 30px {{ colors.primary }}80;
      line-height: 1.2;
    }
    
    .subtitle {
      font-size: 16px;
      color: #cccccc;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
      padding: 0 10px;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }
    
    .cta-button {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 18px 40px;
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: bold;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: #ffffff;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, {{ colors.accent }} 0%, {{ colors.accent }}DD 100%);
      border-radius: 50px;
      border: none;
      border-bottom: 6px solid #CC0000;
      box-shadow: 
        0 10px 40px rgba(255, 107, 107, 0.6),
        0 0 60px rgba(255, 107, 107, 0.4),
        inset 0 -5px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3),
        inset 0 5px 20px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      cursor: pointer;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
    }
    
    .features {
      padding: 40px 15px;
    }
    
    .features-title {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 28px;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, {{ colors.primary }} 0%, {{ colors.secondary }} 100%);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      background-clip: text;
    }
    
    .features-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 20px;
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    
    .feature-card {
      background: rgba(26, 26, 46, 0.8);
      padding: 25px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      border: 2px solid {{ colors.primary }}4D;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
      text-align: center;
    }
    
    .feature-icon {
      font-size: 40px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }
    
    .feature-title {
      font-size: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      color: {{ colors.primary }};
      font-weight: bold;
    }
    
    .feature-desc {
      color: #cccccc;
      line-height: 1.6;
      font-size: 15px;
    }
    
    .content-section {
      padding: 40px 15px 100px;
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    
    .content-section h2 {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 28px;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, {{ colors.primary }} 0%, {{ colors.secondary }} 100%);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      background-clip: text;
    }
    
    .content-article {
      background: rgba(26, 26, 46, 0.8);
      padding: 30px 20px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      border: 2px solid {{ colors.primary }}33;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
      line-height: 1.8;
      color: #cccccc;
    }
    
    .content-article h2 {
      color: {{ colors.primary }};
      font-size: 24px;
      margin: 25px 0 15px;
      text-align: left;
      background: none;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: {{ colors.primary }};
    }
    
    .content-article h2:first-child {
      margin-top: 0;
    }
    
    .content-article h3 {
      color: {{ colors.primary }};
      font-size: 20px;
      margin: 25px 0 15px;
    }
    
    .content-article p {
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }
    
    .content-article ul,
    .content-article ol {
      margin: 15px 0;
      padding-left: 25px;
    }
    
    .content-article li {
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    
    .content-article img {
      width: 100%;
      height: auto;
      margin: 20px 0;
      border-radius: 15px;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
      display: block;
    }
    
    .content-article a {
      color: {{ colors.primary }};
      text-decoration: none;
      border-bottom: 1px solid {{ colors.primary }}4D;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
    }
    
    .content-article a:hover {
      border-bottom-color: {{ colors.primary }};
    }
    
    .sticky-footer {
      position: fixed;
      bottom: 0;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.95);
      padding: 12px 15px;
      border-top: 2px solid {{ colors.primary }}4D;
      z-index: 999;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: stretch;
      gap: 8px;
      box-shadow: 0 -5px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
      transform: translate3d(0, 0, 0);
      -webkit-transform: translate3d(0, 0, 0);
    }

    .footer-gif {
      width: 100%;
      display: block;
    }

    .footer-buttons {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: stretch;
      gap: 10px;
    }
    
    .footer-button {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 14px 20px;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: bold;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: #ffffff;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, {{ colors.secondary }} 0%, {{ colors.primary }} 100%);
      border-radius: 12px;
      border: none;
      border-bottom: 4px solid #CC8800;
      box-shadow: 
        0 5px 30px {{ colors.primary }}99,
        inset 0 -3px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      flex: 1;
      max-width: 180px;
      text-align: center;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }
  </style>
  
  <script type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "Article",
    "headline": "{{ p.title }}",
    "description": "{{ p.description }}",
    "author": {
      "@type": "Person",
      "name": "{{ p.author }}"
    },
    "publisher": {
      "@type": "Organization",
      "name": "{{ p.site_name }}",
      "logo": {
        "@type": "ImageObject",
        "url": "{{ p.site_logo_url }}"
      }
    },
    "datePublished": "2025-11-20T00:00:00+07:00",
    "dateModified": "2025-11-10T00:00:00+07:00"
  }
  </script>
  
  <script type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
    "itemListElement": [{
      "@type": "ListItem",
      "position": 1,
      "name": "☢️ Ctrl Z",
      "item": "{{ p.site_home_url }}"
    },{
      "@type": "ListItem",
      "position": 2,
      "name": "☢️ Ctrl Z",
      "item": "{{ p.canonical_url }}"
    }]
  }
  </script>
  
  <script type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "Organization",
    "name": "{{ p.site_name }}",
    "url": "{{ p.site_home_url }}",
    "logo": "{{ p.site_logo_url }}",
    "aggregateRating": {
      "@type": "AggregateRating",
      "ratingValue": "4.8",
      "bestRating": "5",
      "worstRating": "1",
      "reviewCount": "150"
    }
  }
  </script>
</head>
<body>
  <amp-auto-ads type="adsense" data-ad-client="ca-pub-1495841003681168"></amp-auto-ads>
  <header>
    <img src="{{ p.logo if p.logo else '/images/100vip-logo.webp' }}" 
         width="150" 
         height="auto" 
         alt="Logo" 
         fetchpriority="high" 
         style="display: block;">
  </header>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="floating-image">
      <img src="/images/float-money.webp" 
           width="536" 
           height="390" 
           alt="Floating Money" 
           fetchpriority="high">
    </div>
    
    <h1>{{ p.title }}</h1>
    
    <p class="subtitle">
      {{ p.description }}
    </p>
    
    <a href="{{ p.cta_link }}" class="cta-button">
      NHẬN THƯỞNG +58K NGAY
    </a>
  </section>
  <section class="features">
    <h2 class="features-title">{{ p.features_title }}</h2>
    
    <div class="features-grid">
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">🎁</div>
        <h3 class="feature-title">Thưởng Khủng</h3>
        <p class="feature-desc">
          Nhận ngay 58K khi đăng ký. Thưởng nạp đầu lên đến 300%. 
          Hoàn trả không giới hạn mỗi tuần.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">⚡</div>
        <h3 class="feature-title">Rút Tiền Nhanh</h3>
        <p class="feature-desc">
          Xử lý rút tiền trong 5 phút. Hỗ trợ mọi ngân hàng và ví điện tử. 
          Không giới hạn số lần rút.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">🔒</div>
        <h3 class="feature-title">An Toàn 100%</h3>
        <p class="feature-desc">
          Mã hóa SSL 256-bit. Bảo mật thông tin tuyệt đối. 
          Giấy phép cá cược quốc tế uy tín.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">🎮</div>
        <h3 class="feature-title">Đa Dạng Trò Chơi</h3>
        <p class="feature-desc">
          Hơn 1000+ trò chơi từ các nhà cung cấp hàng đầu. 
          Casino trực tuyến, thể thao, xổ số, bắn cá.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">💬</div>
        <h3 class="feature-title">Hỗ Trợ 24/7</h3>
        <p class="feature-desc">
          Đội ngũ chăm sóc khách hàng chuyên nghiệp. 
          Hỗ trợ qua chat, điện thoại, email mọi lúc.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">📱</div>
        <h3 class="feature-title">Mọi Thiết Bị</h3>
        <p class="feature-desc">
          Chơi mượt mà trên điện thoại, máy tính bảng, PC. 
          Giao diện tối ưu cho mọi màn hình.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="content-section">
    <article class="content-article">
      {{ p.content | safe }}
    </article>
  </section>
  <div class="sticky-footer">
    <amp-anim class="footer-gif"
      src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/1R5y9OBe9ELJ_96grDYSyeYcvJPBy3b46=w728?authuser=0"
      width="728"
      height="90"
      layout="responsive"
      alt="Banner">
    </amp-anim>
    <div class="footer-buttons">
      <a href="{{ p.cta_link }}" class="footer-button">
        🎁 NHẬN 58K
      </a>
      <a href="{{ p.cta_link }}" class="footer-button">
        💰 X2 NẠP ĐẦU
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
